## 4. File Change Summary Tables

| File Path | Action | Component / Section | Change Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `src/store/ui.js` | Modify | `actions.openApp` | **Root-cause fix.** Corrected to the Vuex `(context, payload)` contract; accepts a bare key string or `{ appKey, payload }`. Previously the action context was passed as the app key, so `APPS[context]` was always `undefined` and no app ever opened. |
| `src/store/ui.js` | Modify | `mutations.setActiveTab` | Unified: delegates every non-home tab to `openApp` in **both** modes (panel on desktop, route on mobile). Fixes aliased keys such as `planning`. `home` kept as a special "clear" case + route on mobile. |
| `src/store/ui.js` | Modify | `mutations.showTab` | Now simply delegates to `setActiveTab` (avoids duplicate/incorrect `showApp` calls). |
| `src/store/ui.js` | Modify | `mutations.openChat`, `mutations.openFileInViewer` | Call `openApp({ appKey, payload })` so the payload is no longer dropped by Vuex single-payload dispatch. |
| `src/store/ui.js` | Modify | `actions.openTeamChannel` / `openTeamDM` / `openTeamMediaLibrary` / `openWorkspace` / `openMeet` / `openTutorial` | Converted 2-arg `openApp(key, payload)` calls to the `{ appKey, payload }` form. |
| `src/components/layout/AppsSection.vue` | Modify | `methods` | All app links now go through one `openApp(appKey)` helper → `$ui.setActiveTab(appKey)`, mapped to the correct keys: `tasks`, `planning`, `messenger`, `meet`, `file-explorer`, `wiki`. Removed the mixed `apps.openKanban`/`$ui.openMeet`/`$ui.openPlanning` + `setActiveTab` inconsistency. |

---

## 5. Verification Checklist

- [ ] **Mobile → Apps → File Explorer** opens `/file-explorer` (renders `FileExplorerPanel` via `AppRouteView`).
- [ ] **Mobile → Messenger / Wiki / Meet / Task Manager / Planning** each open their route.
- [ ] **Desktop → Apps → Planning** opens the Task Manager on the Planning view (previously created a broken `planning` panel).
- [ ] **Desktop → Apps → File Explorer / Wiki / Messenger** still open as panels (no duplicates on repeat clicks).
- [ ] Chat open (`$ui.openChat`) and file open (`$ui.openFileInViewer`) still work on both modes.
- [ ] Console shows **no** `[Navigation] openApp: unknown app ...` warnings.

## Follow-ups (out of scope, same bug class — flagged, not changed)

- `src/components/main-menu/MainMenuItems.vue` and `src/components/MobileMenu.vue` open the File Explorer with the **wrong key** `'file-finder'`, which does not exist in `APPS` (canonical key is `'file-explorer'`). Those menus will still fail until updated to `'file-explorer'`.
- `'media-library'` / `openMediaLibrary` still references a component that isn't in `appComponentsMap.js` (pre-existing, unrelated to mobile routing).

